{"id":"614113","name":"圆白菜饺子","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/614113/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"圆白菜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"180g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"若干"},{"name":"虾米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五花肉剁成末。","img":"images/614113/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"圆白菜(包菜)半个。","img":"images/614113/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成碎粒。","img":"images/614113/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡发好的香菇。","img":"images/614113/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"也切成碎粒。","img":"images/614113/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备姜末、葱末、虾米。","img":"images/614113/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅烧油，把姜、葱、虾米炒出香气。","img":"images/614113/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入香菇丁炒香。","img":"images/614113/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再把猪肉炒熟。","img":"images/614113/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入所有调料，翻炒入味。","img":"images/614113/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后倒入圆白菜。","img":"images/614113/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻炒入味即可。","img":"images/614113/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"准备饺子皮，开始包。","img":"images/614113/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"饺子皮内放入馅料。","img":"images/614113/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"每个人都有自己包饺子的独特手艺，这里就不展示包的过程了，原则上不破皮即可。","img":"images/614113/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"饺子放入笼屉，馅料基本上是熟的，水开上气大火蒸十分钟。","img":"images/614113/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"时间到出锅。","img":"images/614113/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"周末窝家吃饺子，相当热乎啊！","img":"images/614113/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/614113/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}